# Git Conventions
- Commit format: `type(scope): description` — e.g., `feat(cart): add quantity selector`, `fix(checkout): prevent double order submit`.
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `style`, `docs`, `chore`, `test`.
- One feature branch per MVP feature/page: `feature/product-details`, `feature/admin-orders`. Merge to `main` when reviewed and working.
- Commit at logical checkpoints within a feature (schema + types → UI → wired to Supabase), not one giant commit per feature.
- Proactively flag when a commit or branch is due, and why, in the moment — not as a generic reminder.
